OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 25 MAR
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GThe BBC Philharmonic Orchestra
OL,6,     Gpresent a concert to welcome the
OL,7,     Garrival of Spring inspired by the
OL,8,     Gseasons, plus music by Vaughan
OL,9,     GWilliams and his contemporaries
OL,10,     Gfrom LSO St. Luke's.
OL,11,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GFrom St Barnabas Church, Ealing,
OL,13,     GLondon, with Imperial College
OL,14,     GChamber Choir.
OL,15,G1600FComposer of the Week: Thomas Ades
OL,16,     GDonald Macleod asks Thomas Ades
OL,17,     Gabout his forays into performing
OL,18,     Gand taking up roles as music
OL,19,     Gdirector for Birmingham
OL,20,     GContemporary Music Group and the
OL,21,     GAldeburgh Festival.
